{"role": "agent", "utterance": "Hi Jordan, this is Riley, a virtual recruiting assistant with Acme Health, calling about the Medical ICU nurse position you applied for. Is now a good time to talk for a few minutes?"}
{"role": "user", "utterance": "Yeah, I've got a few minutes before my shift."}
{"role": "agent", "utterance": "Thanks. Before we start, this call is recorded and shared with our recruiting team. Is it okay to continue?"}
{"role": "user", "utterance": "That's fine, go ahead."}
{"role": "agent", "utterance": "Great. Do you hold an active Colorado RN license, or an active multistate compact license?"}
{"role": "user", "utterance": "Yep, my Colorado license is active."}
{"role": "agent", "utterance": "Thanks. Which certifications do you currently hold?"}
{"role": "user", "utterance": "BLS is good through '27. ACLS actually lapsed in September, but I'm booked into a renewal class on the 30th. I've also got PALS and TNCC."}
